# Copy to api/.env and fill in what you have. Never commit the filled-in file.
#
# Nothing below is needed for B1-B5. The schema, the seed, the ledger, the
# rhythm engine and the expiry rule all run with this file exactly as it is.

# Local Postgres. On macOS with Homebrew the role is your own username and
# there is no password, so the default usually works and you can leave this
# commented out.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://localhost:5432/bahi

# Voice (V2) - Sarvam speech-to-text. saaras:v4 hears the entry; the names of the
# people at the counter are passed as keyterms. The readback uses the browser's
# own Hindi voice for now; bulbul:v3 comes with the Soundbox sounds (V7).
# SARVAM_API_KEY=
# SARVAM_STT_MODEL=saaras:v4

# Serve every spoken line from the on-disk cache and never call Sarvam.
# THIS IS THE MODE WE DEMO IN — the venue wifi is assumed to fail.
# Offline is also the default when this line is missing entirely.
# SARVAM_OFFLINE=1

# B9 - n8n Cloud, for the 11pm schedule.
# N8N_API_KEY=
# N8N_BASE_URL=
